Module: Mathlib.NumberTheory.Divisors
Name: Nat.image_div_divisors_eq_divisors
Description: For any natural number $n$, the image of the function $x \mapsto n/x$ applied to the set of divisors of $n$ is equal to the set of divisors of $n$ itself. In symbols:
$$\left\{ \frac{n}{x} \mid x \in \text{divisors}(n) \right\} = \text{divisors}(n).$$
Signature:  (n : ℕ) : image (fun x : ℕ => n / x) n.divisors = n.divisors

