3. [THEOREM] Nonempty Universal Finset iff Nonempty Type
Module: Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Basic
Name: Finset.univ_nonempty_iff
Description: The universal finset of a type $\alpha$ is nonempty if and only if the type $\alpha$ itself is nonempty, i.e., $\text{univ.Nonempty} \leftrightarrow \text{Nonempty } \alpha$.
