   The sum of the elements of a singleton finset `{2016}` is just `2016`. In Lean this follows from `Finset.sum_singleton`. Hence  

   \[
   \bigl(\sum_{k\in S} k\bigr)=2016 .
   \]

9. **Conclusion.**  
   The goal `(∑ k in S, k) = 2016` is proved.

∎
